/// API keys come from the environment: `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` (fallback
/// `OPENAI_API_KEY`) for the default `openai-completions` provider,
/// `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` for `anthropic`, `GOOGLE_API_KEY` for `google`.
